url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/ebb05d9994047fdb04f418d0a886c56e3268723e"},"message":"Fix hangs on SIGTERM.\n\nThis fixes #1469, where three bugs pervent main from existing on\nSIGTERM.\n\nThe first two are blocking receiving from cancel chanels which never\nhave values sent to them, cancelStateUpdateChan and\ncancelPolicyUpdateChan. It seems closing the chanels should be all the\nis needed to signal the watching goroutines to exit.\n\nThe other is the signal hander never exiting an infinite for loop. The\nsigFunc is called in an errorGroup which blocks exiting Serve and thus\nmain. It looks like a refactor in #1382 removed an os.Exit(0),\nreplacing it with a return breaks out of the loop.","parents":[{"sha":"23a3adf8d27d3fe36aa531159ca9edd77eeca8fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/23a3adf8d27d3fe36aa531159ca9edd77eeca8fa","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/23a3adf8d27d3fe36aa531159ca9edd77eeca8fa"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":9751947742,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz885nBfy7zwAAAAJFQune","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/9751947742","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","e